The lists hold file names, partition assignments, video identifiers and, in
ieee_shared_frames_check.csv, statistics of a frame comparison. They contain no video, image or
annotation data of either dataset. The file names are those of the IEEE DataPort
Traffic Accident Detection Video Dataset (doi:10.21227/tjtg-nz28) and the video identifiers
those of the CADP dataset (doi:10.1109/AVSS.2018.8639160). Both datasets remain under the terms
of their own providers.
